    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Patch and Price Cut!</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Added Steam achievements.<br></li><li> Fixed Double Deck bug.<br></li><li> Fixed Memory crash.<br></li><li> Added Auto Reshuffle option.<br></li><li> Reshuffle automatically recharges if there are no matches.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Plus Everything from the Original Game!</h2><br><br>Includes 15 exciting and unique Mahjongg game variations in one collection. Enjoy the following games:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Traditional tile matching gameplay with 100 unique layouts.<br></li><li>Solitaire variations such as Doubles, Flip It, Hide and Peek, Golden Dragon, Freecell, Ten Spot, and Countdown.<br></li><li>25 double-sized layouts with twice the tiles.<br></li><li>Go head-to-head in two player mode.<br></li><li>Other fun variations like Nanjing, Four Rivers, Waterfalls, Memory, and Collapse.</li></ul><br>Features relaxing gameplay that's fun for the whole family.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>30 beautiful tile sets.<br></li><li>Modern interface with easy-to-use design.<br></li><li>Track your high score, best times, and in-game achievements.<br></li><li>150 backgrounds to choose from.<br></li><li>Layout Editor to create your own levels.</li></ul>",
